   "",
   "\t<<addinlineevent \"mines\">>",
   "\t\t<<generate1>><<generate2>>",
   "\t\tYou overhear a <<person1>><<priest>> talking to a <<person2>><<monk>>.",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "\t\t<<if $mine?.freed isnot 1>>",
   "\t\t\t<<if $town_projects.bridge gte 4>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"Have you noticed that the amount of initiates going missing has gone down recently?\" the <<monk>> asks.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"Virgo has blessed us and protected them,\" the <<person1>><<priest>> claims.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"I think it's more so a result of the recent construction of a bridge to the flats,\" the <<person2>><<monk>> says.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "\t\t\t\tThe <<person1>><<priest>> gives <<person2>><<him>> a dirty look.",
   "\t\t\t<<else>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"Have you noticed that the amount of initiates going missing around Barb Street has gone up recently?\" the <<monk>> asks.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"Aye, I'm planning on recommending that initiates steer clear of that area,\" the <<person1>><<priest>> answers.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\t\"I wonder what happened to them,\" the <<person2>><<monk>> muses.",
   "\t\t\t<</if>>",
   "\t\t<<else>>",
   "\t\t\t\"Have you noticed that the cloister has been more active as of late?\" the <<monk>> asks.",
   "\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\"Well, most of the missing initiates have turned up,\" the <<person1>><<priest>> says.<<gggrace>><<grace 5>>",
   "\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\"Though some are still missing I'm afraid.\" <<He>> looks sad. \"I pray they turn up one day.\" <<gstress>><<stress 5>>",
   "\t\t<</if>>",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "\t\t<<endevent>>",
   "\t\t<<link [[Next|Temple]]>><</link>>",
   "",
